    <briefdescription>
<para>This is used by <ref refid="_aggressive_inst_combine_8cpp_1a8f64e8576d57bb362e730214c7e6fae9" kindref="member">foldLoadsRecursive()</ref> to capture a Root Load node which is of type or(load, load) and recursively build the wide load. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Also capture the shift amount, zero extend type and loadSize. </para>
